//! # hopper-core
//!
//! FROGGER protocol core: the v6 envelope, the fold document, the
//! deterministic frog art, and the death model.
//!
//! This crate is the single source of truth shared by the indexer, the
//! desktop wallet, and the Android wallet. It is deliberately
//! dependency-minimal (sha2 only) and must cross-compile for
//! `aarch64-linux-android`.
//!
//! Conformance: `tests/golden.rs` asserts bit-exact agreement with the
//! frozen Python reference (`reference/artgen.py`, `reference/envelope.py`)
//! via `testdata/golden.json` (generated by `tools/gen_golden.py`).
//!
//! Protocol reference: `docs/V6-SPEC.md`. Earlier versions (v2's game,
//! v3's tickets, v5's live art) are not implemented by this build.

